   care : ∃ H: Attire (φ:=φ) R D Ψ Actors U (minted R m b w) η Z' ( Sycamore.life R (i+1) b Z' ε ) ( Sycamore.rent R m (i+1) b ) X, Poster R hk D Q π Γ Ψ Q0 hℓ hN Actors U qP η Z' ( Sycamore.life R (i+1) b Z' ε ) ( Sycamore.rent R m (i+1) b ) X H ( program i hℓ hl ) Qa Y
