-- Present at a true independent test family. W (radius) and cost fixed. Applies to any Key:
-- launch_key through response (and actual relative exponent budget) of common layout chosen above.
-- Motive uses weighted norm after **paying back** ANY declared per-marker kernel envelopes.
-- Runtime formulas aren't perturbed. Thus including a very small factor on prior correction
-- inputs doesn't require by-term majorant on solving P states once a radius-normalized input to
-- this procedure is paid. Doesn't claim input hypotheses from other sums.
local notation "W"=> Ψt (Λ)
local notation "T₀"=> Ψt ( remainder R Ψ Actors Vr )
